(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 138.43 153.162 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b69e708f-acb7-4bbc-a9d4-af2c62176a48"))
(text "HSO-5 CARD, card type 0x0012. 5 protected high-side outputs (TPS1HTC30-class,\nbaseline AUX1-AUX5 circuit); a 2nd instance replaces AUX6-AUX10.\nSelf-contained: own SN74LVC541A enable buffer (outputs only enabled while\nOUT_EN_N is low), own TMUX1208 current-sense mux to ANA_OUT, own BAT54C\nclamps, own MCP23S17 behind IOFF slot buffers.\nPass 1: REQ/DIAG_EN/MUX_A 47k pull-downs (boot-safe), OUT_EN_N pull-up on\n+3V3_ID, 100 nF/100 V at every VS + 2.2 uF bulk, ILIM 33.2k (2.41/3.01/3.61\nA), R_SNS 910 + 4.7k into the clamp. CARD_FAULT_N pulled up on the backplane\nonly.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-4 OUT1-5_REQ, GPA5 DIAG_EN, GPA6-7 SLOT_ID0/1; GPB0-4\nOUT1-5_RB_N, GPB5-7 MUX_A0-2. SLOT_ID2/IDP not read (no spare GPIO): slot\nidentity also comes from the I2C mux channel.\nBaseline names: OUTk = AUXk. Net changes: net_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 139.7 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1d2cdaa9-89b5-40dd-9895-db419a386f06"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
